{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/matchingmodule\/galeshapleyevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GaleShapleyEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Free proposers are taken from a stack, lowest index first at the start. A free proposer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"proposes to the next reviewer on its list. The reviewer rejects a proposer it does not list or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ranks below the one it holds, accepts when it holds no one, and otherwise trades up, freeing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the proposer it held, who goes on top of the stack. A rejected proposer proposes again; an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accepted one waits. A proposer whose list runs out stays unmatched. The pairs held at the end","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are ","type":"text"},{"code":"stableMatching","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s matching.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14MatchingModule16GaleShapleyEventO","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GaleShapleyEvent"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","title":"GaleShapleyEvent","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GaleShapleyEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MatchingModule"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"GaleShapleyEvents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/MatchingModule\/GaleShapleyEvents.swift#L10"}},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"majo